/**
 * The single gateway surface for the app. Joins the normalized microservice-shaped
 * tables (catalog / directory / reviews / inventory / checkout / accounts / home-sdui)
 * as served by the Go Chi modular monolith (`server/gateway`).
 *
 * Two modes:
 *  - REMOTE (default when `GATEWAY_URL` + `USE_GATEWAY=true` are generated by
 *    `scripts/configure.js`): real HTTP against the gateway. Reads and writes are server-only —
 *    a failed/disabled remote call throws instead of substituting an `@data/*` fixture, so the
 *    app never shows mocked rows as if they were live.
 *  - OFFLINE (`USE_GATEWAY=false` / no `GATEWAY_URL`): every call throws `GatewayOfflineError`; a
 *    screen renders its own honest offline state rather than fixture data.
 *
 * See data/DATA_CONTROL.md, docs/architecture/data-layer-sdui.md,
 * docs/architecture/mvp-backend.md §3, docs/architecture/monolith-breakdown.md.
 */
